---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="One home for every rescue story" description="BarkHaus connects animal records, rescue websites, applications, and outreach in one workspace. Explore the platform and request early access.">
  <Navbar currentPage="/" />
  <main>
    <section class="bh-hero">
      <div class="bh-container bh-hero-grid">
        <div class="bh-hero-copy">
          <p class="bh-kicker"><span class="bh-dot"></span> A better home for rescue work</p>
          <h1>One animal record.<br /><em>Every next step.</em></h1>
          <p class="bh-lead">From the first intake note to the day they go home, BarkHaus connects the details your team manages with the stories your community sees.</p>
          <div class="bh-actions"><a class="bh-button bh-button-primary" href="/contact">Talk to us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="bh-button bh-button-secondary" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
          <p class="bh-hero-note">Built for animal rescues, shelters, and foster teams.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bh-hero-art" aria-label="Animal record connecting to a public listing and an application">
          <div class="bh-orbit bh-orbit-one"></div><div class="bh-orbit bh-orbit-two"></div>
          <div class="bh-record"><div class="bh-record-photo"><img src="/images/home-hero-header-section-0.jpg" alt="Happy rescue dog" width="640" height="480" fetchpriority="high" /></div><div class="bh-record-body"><span class="bh-mini-label">ANIMAL PROFILE</span><strong>Meet your next best friend</strong><span>Photos · Story · Care notes</span><span class="bh-status"><span></span> Ready for a home</span></div></div>
          <div class="bh-float bh-float-site"><span class="bh-float-icon">↗</span><div><small>PUBLIC WEBSITE</small><strong>Listing updated</strong></div></div>
          <div class="bh-float bh-float-app"><span class="bh-float-icon">♡</span><div><small>APPLICATIONS</small><strong>A new connection</strong></div></div>
          <div class="bh-hero-caption">ONE UPDATE, A CONNECTED JOURNEY <span>01 / 04</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bh-intro" id="how-it-works"><div class="bh-container bh-intro-grid"><p class="bh-overline">THE IDEA IS SIMPLE</p><h2>Your rescue shouldn't have to enter the same story <em>four times.</em></h2><p>Animal details often live in one spreadsheet, photos in another folder, applications in an inbox, and website updates on someone's to-do list. BarkHaus is being built to bring those pieces together around the animal.</p></div></section>

    <section class="bh-journey"><div class="bh-container">
      <div class="bh-section-head"><div><p class="bh-overline">THE CONNECTED JOURNEY</p><h2>One place to start.<br /><em>More places to make an impact.</em></h2></div><p>Make the animal profile your starting point. The next steps can follow without losing the context behind them.</p></div>
      <div class="bh-journey-grid">
        <article><span class="bh-number">01 / RECORD</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><h3>Know every animal</h3><p>Keep photos, background, medical details, and availability together in a record your team can use.</p><a href="/features/animals">Animal management <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article><span class="bh-number">02 / WEBSITE</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><h3>Show their story</h3><p>Give adoptable animals a place on a rescue website that reflects your organization and stays current.</p><a href="/features/public-website">Public websites <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article><span class="bh-number">03 / APPLICATIONS</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><h3>Follow the connection</h3><p>Bring adoption, foster, and volunteer interest into an organized review workflow.</p><a href="/features/applications">Applications <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article><span class="bh-number">04 / OUTREACH</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>Share what matters</h3><p>Use the information already in the record to prepare stories and updates for your community.</p><a href="/features/social-media">Outreach tools <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="bh-feature bh-feature-light"><div class="bh-container bh-feature-grid"><div class="bh-feature-visual"><img src="/images/barkhaus_dog_and_vet.png" alt="Veterinarian caring for a dog" loading="lazy" width="960" height="720" /><span class="bh-image-tag">THE WHOLE STORY, IN ONE PLACE</span></div><div class="bh-feature-copy"><p class="bh-overline">BUILT AROUND THE ANIMAL</p><h2>A record that goes beyond a name and a photo.</h2><p>Intake, care, photos, personality, and adoption status belong together. Your team gets the fuller picture, and a change in availability can carry through to the experience adopters see.</p><ul><li>Keep the details that help a match feel right</li><li>Organize the journey from intake to adoption</li><li>Give every team member a shared starting point</li></ul><a class="bh-text-link" href="/features/animals">Explore animal management <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-feature bh-feature-cream"><div class="bh-container bh-feature-grid bh-feature-reverse"><div class="bh-feature-visual"><img src="/images/barkhaus_dog_happy_family.png" alt="Family spending time with an adopted dog" loading="lazy" width="960" height="720" /><span class="bh-image-tag">FROM DISCOVERY TO A NEW HOME</span></div><div class="bh-feature-copy"><p class="bh-overline">MADE FOR THE PEOPLE, TOO</p><h2>A better experience on both sides of the adoption.</h2><p>Give prospective adopters a clear path from an animal's page to an application. Give your rescue a place to review interest and keep the next steps moving.</p><a class="bh-text-link" href="/features/applications">Explore applications <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-platform"><div class="bh-container bh-platform-grid"><div><p class="bh-overline">A PLATFORM THAT GROWS WITH YOU</p><h2>More room for the work behind every rescue.</h2></div><div class="bh-platform-links"><a href="/features/public-website"><span>01</span><strong>Your public website</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/features/social-media"><span>02</span><strong>Social content tools</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/features/inbox"><span>03</span><strong>Community conversations</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/features"><span>04</span><strong>Explore all capabilities</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-cta"><div class="bh-container bh-cta-inner"><div><p class="bh-overline">LET'S BUILD THE NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2>More time for the animals.<br /><em>Less time between tools.</em></h2><p>Tell us about your rescue and what would make your day easier. BarkHaus is in active development, and we'd love to hear from you.</p></div><a class="bh-button bh-button-light" href="/contact">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
